 "remarks": "Spacious 2BR/2BA, 1,232 sq. ft. residence at Belden Square Apartments in central Norwalk. Open living/dining area with wood-style flooring and crown molding flows into a kitchen with white cabinets, peninsula counter, and stainless steel appliances. Includes in-unit washer/dryer, central A/C, two full tub/shower baths, carpeted bedrooms, and ample closets. Building features elevators, gym/recreation room, grill/picnic area, and underground covered parking. Convenient to dining, Connecticut Ave retail, shopping Mall, parks, Norwalk Hospital, commuter routes, buss station, and East/South Norwalk train stations. Additional monthly fees apply for garage parking ($75) and trash($35). Excellent credit and References required.",
